  <para style="s1">Readiness at Any Hour</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 6:1-7">Genesis 6:1–7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mark 13:32–37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:35-48">Luke 12:35–48</ref>)</para>
